WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.054
Sam: I told the lifeguard we were sorry.

2
00:00:09.055 --> 00:00:16.892
Why do we have to leave the beach?

3
00:00:16.893 --> 00:00:21.571
Dad: The beach is too crowded for dogs today.

4
00:00:21.572 --> 00:00:25.386
Mom: It's okay,

5
00:00:25.387 --> 00:00:30.458
Sam. We can get ice cream instead.

6
00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:34.251
Lilly: Ice cream!

7
00:00:34.252 --> 00:00:38.395
Sam: Can Lucky get some ice cream too?

8
00:00:38.396 --> 00:00:55.808
Mom: Of

9
00:00:55.809 --> 00:01:01.370
course. Sam: Look at that

10
00:01:01.371 --> 00:01:09.932
sign. It says "No Dogs Allowed."

11
00:01:09.933 --> 00:01:23.120
Dad: Sorry, Lucky.

12
00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:32.247
Sam: Lucky looks so unhappy

13
00:01:32.248 --> 00:01:40.586
outside. He's barking very loudly too.

14
00:01:40.587 --> 00:01:43.297
Sam: Here, Lucky.

15
00:01:43.298 --> 00:01:48.989
I brought you some ice cream. It's

16
00:01:48.990 --> 00:02:03.537
your favorite flavor—strawberry. Mom:

17
00:02:03.538 --> 00:02:11.555
The beach was nice. But this is fun too. Dad:

18
00:02:11.556 --> 00:02:20.384
Let's go to the bookstore now.

19
00:02:20.385 --> 00:02:41.575
Sam: Oh no. I see another sign!

